<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#FloatingPointPredictor> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Adobe TIFF Technical Note 3's floating-point predictor: each row's sample bytes regrouped by significance (every sample's most significant byte first) and differenced byte by byte, each byte predicted from the byte samplesPerPixel positions earlier. Decoding sums the differences and reassembles the samples in the byte order littleEndian names."@en .
