<https://hexplain.io/ns/register/media-encoding#LERC> <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Esri's Limited Error Raster Compression version 2 (blob versions 1-6), decoded bit for bit as Esri LERC 4.0 decodes it. layout blob returns every band's samples band after band with a validity mask per band; layout tiff assembles one TIFF strip or tile of width x height x samplesPerPixel samples as libtiff's tif_lerc.c does (masks become NaN for floats or alpha when alphaFromMask), first unwrapping the Deflate or Zstandard layer lercParameters names."@en .
